1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,454
Writing, task two. E-mail number 15: A complaint.

2
00:00:06,167 --> 00:00:16,983
You were at a restaurant and weren't happy. Write an e-mail to the owner, at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:25,667 --> 00:00:26,733
Hello,

4
00:00:27,033 --> 00:00:29,674
on Saturday evening I was at your restaurant with my family.

5
00:00:29,967 --> 00:00:32,391
We ordered pasta and two pizzas.

6
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:35,278
The food was cold and the pizza was burnt.

7
00:00:35,567 --> 00:00:38,541
We waited an hour for the food and the waiter was rude.

8
00:00:38,833 --> 00:00:42,833
I would like you to refund part of the money or give us a discount next time.

9
00:00:43,133 --> 00:00:50,574
This e-mail has 52 words. There is one sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and at the end.

10
00:00:51,267 --> 00:01:00,277
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
